  "limits": [
    "Public Begin still rejects review-bearing requests and the frontend still emits None. Original-object identity across worker CAS, accepted-but-unstarted retry and active partial recovery still needs enforcement, including original children inside moved directories. The aggregate alone cannot distinguish expected own namespace/ctime changes from every replacement after a partial operation; current accepted recovery intentionally skips old service/proof freshness. This checkpoint is not complete native mutation/recovery identity enforcement.",
    "The signed observation describes actual normalizer reads and namespace checks. It does not claim visibility into every private language-server read; declared project inputs and associated-source observation retain their separate contracts.",
    "Windows all-target cross-compilation checks the path-based adapter and native identity/change-time calls. Descriptor anchoring and native Windows filesystem/event behavior are not proven by that cross-compilation.",
    "The metadata pool is conservative charged accounting for these observations, not complete process/browser/in-flight-result memory accounting or a measured whole-host memory bound. No prefetch benefit or timing claim is made.",
    "Installed Local fixtures use OPFS/native correspondence. Physical permission prompts and Local review-bearing process-kill restoration are separate outstanding evidence.",
    "The matrix includes strict target checks, native libraries, full bridge tests, selected browser modules and a Windows cross-check. It is not the final complete pre-push integration/browser/editor/font/real-server gate. Both existing ignored tests remain unexecuted here.",
    "Complete writer/child/cross-process exclusion, cache/memory/prefetch work, Terraform public SDK/toolkit publication, exact-head CI/nightly publication and cleanup remain unfinished. Editor performance is parked."
  ]
